A Shoal isn't subtle at all. A Wound sure as hell isn't subtle either (pun intended).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-04T12:33:49-08:00","id":359424,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/353085-wound-s-realm-is-the-hell?p=359176#post359176\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The second glance is provided by the spirits and possible forms the shadow can take in terms of landscapes. A frigging truck spirit being run to the ground by a fleet of predatory car spirits acting like a pack of wolves is damn near bizarre to observe, and not subtle at all.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's still in bizarre way as Silent Hill monster you can see in Fog Bound world. Hey, even one of monsters looks like <a href=\"http://silenthill.wikia.com/wiki/Abstract_Daddy\" target=\"_blank\">predatory doors</a>!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/353085-wound-s-realm-is-the-hell?p=359176#post359176\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A Shoal isn't subtle at all. A Wound sure as hell isn't subtle either (pun intended).</div> </div> </div> </div>They are <b>anomalies</b> in general Shadow Realm, according to Forsaken 1ed corebook - of course they should not be subtle. Like, if normal <i>Hisil</i> is more or less <i>Fog Bound</i> Silent Hill, the Wound would be <i>Otherworld</i> part of town - difference are to be seen on first glance, even if both version are &quot;based on our reality, only twisted&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}